{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Interactions.WedderburnMassFormula","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Interactions.WedderburnMassFormula","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Group.Finset.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Log.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.NormNum","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Positivity"],"declarations":42,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.alpha_bind_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.alpha_bind_pos","kind":"theorem","line":305,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/WedderburnMassFormula.lean#L305-L311","doc":"**Numerical sanity check.** The binding scale `α > 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.catalan_G_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.catalan_G_pos","kind":"theorem","line":300,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/WedderburnMassFormula.lean#L300-L303","doc":"**Numerical sanity check.** Catalan's constant is positive. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.rest_masses_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.rest_masses_pos","kind":"theorem","line":295,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/WedderburnMassFormula.lean#L295-L298","doc":"**Numerical sanity check.** All three rest masses are positive. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.wedderburnMass_succ_N","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.wedderburnMass_succ_N","kind":"theorem","line":282,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/WedderburnMassFormula.lean#L282-L293","doc":"**Mass is monotone in `N` along the neutron-rich axis.** Adding\none neutron (with proton number fixed) increases the leading\nrest-mass term by `m_n`, plus the binding-term shift. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.wedderburnMass_succ_Z","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.wedderburnMass_succ_Z","kind":"theorem","line":267,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/WedderburnMassFormula.lean#L267-L280","doc":"**Mass is monotone in `Z` along the proton-rich axis.** Adding\none proton (with neutron number fixed) increases the leading\nrest-mass term by `m_p + m_e`. The binding term is `Z`-dependent\nvia `V_std`, `λ^sym`, `λ^alt` (opaque), so we can only state the\nrest-mass part as an algebraic identity. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.wedderburn_weights_q_only","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.wedderburn_weights_q_only","kind":"theorem","line":259,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/WedderburnMassFormula.lean#L259-L265","doc":"**Zero-fitted-parameter property.** The Wedderburn weights are\ndetermined by `q` alone — they contain no free coupling\nconstants. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.wedderburn_weights_sum_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.wedderburn_weights_sum_pos","kind":"theorem","line":249,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/WedderburnMassFormula.lean#L249-L257","doc":"**Wedderburn weights are strictly positive at any `q > 0`.**\nThe full sum `w_sym + w_std + w_alt > 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.wedderburn_weights_sum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.wedderburn_weights_sum","kind":"theorem","line":239,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/WedderburnMassFormula.lean#L239-L247","doc":"**Wedderburn weight identity at the baryon level.**\n`w_sym + w_std + w_alt = (2 + [2]_q²) / [3]_q!`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.wedderburnMass_split","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.wedderburnMass_split","kind":"theorem","line":228,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/WedderburnMassFormula.lean#L228-L237","doc":"**Wedderburn mass formula (definitional expansion).** The mass\nsplits canonically into nucleon, electron, and binding\ncontributions. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.wedderburnMass","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.wedderburnMass","kind":"def","line":220,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/WedderburnMassFormula.lean#L220-L224","doc":"**Wedderburn neutral-atom mass.**\n`M(Z, N) = Z · m_p + N · m_n + Z · m_e\n          + α · Σᵢ ln |V̂ᵢ^full|`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.bindingTerm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.bindingTerm","kind":"def","line":214,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/WedderburnMassFormula.lean#L214-L218","doc":"The three-invariant Wedderburn binding term\n`α · Σᵢ ln |V̂ᵢ^full|` summed over the chosen NF generators. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.V_full","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.V_full","kind":"def","line":207,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/WedderburnMassFormula.lean#L207-L212","doc":"Full Wedderburn-weighted traced volume per generator `i`:\n`V̂ᵢ^full = w_sym · λᵢ^sym + w_std · V̂ᵢ^std + w_alt · λᵢ^alt`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.w_sym_eq_w_alt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.w_sym_eq_w_alt","kind":"theorem","line":199,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/WedderburnMassFormula.lean#L199-L203","doc":"The symmetric and alternating weights are equal (both equal\n`1/[3]_q!`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.w_std_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.w_std_pos","kind":"theorem","line":189,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/WedderburnMassFormula.lean#L189-L197","doc":"For `q > 0`, the standard weight is strictly positive\n(since `[2]_q² > 0`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.w_alt_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.w_alt_pos","kind":"theorem","line":183,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/WedderburnMassFormula.lean#L183-L187","doc":"For `q > 0`, the alternating weight is strictly positive. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.w_sym_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.w_sym_pos","kind":"theorem","line":177,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/WedderburnMassFormula.lean#L177-L181","doc":"For `q > 0`, the symmetric weight is strictly positive. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.q_fact_3_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.q_fact_3_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":172,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/WedderburnMassFormula.lean#L172-L175","doc":"For `q > 0`, `[3]_q! ≠ 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.q_fact_3_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.q_fact_3_pos","kind":"theorem","line":166,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/WedderburnMassFormula.lean#L166-L170","doc":"For `q > 0`, `[3]_q! = (1 + q + q²)(1 + q) > 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.q_int_3_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.q_int_3_pos","kind":"theorem","line":159,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/WedderburnMassFormula.lean#L159-L164","doc":"For `q > 0`, `[3]_q = 1 + q + q² > 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.q_int_2_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.q_int_2_pos","kind":"theorem","line":154,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/WedderburnMassFormula.lean#L154-L157","doc":"For `q > 0`, `[2]_q = 1 + q > 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.w_std","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.w_std","kind":"def","line":149,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/WedderburnMassFormula.lean#L149-L150","doc":"Standard Wedderburn weight `w_std = [2]_q² / [3]_q!`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.w_alt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.w_alt","kind":"def","line":146,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/WedderburnMassFormula.lean#L146-L147","doc":"Alternating Wedderburn weight `w_alt = 1 / [3]_q!`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.w_sym","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.w_sym","kind":"def","line":143,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/WedderburnMassFormula.lean#L143-L144","doc":"Symmetric Wedderburn weight `w_sym = 1 / [3]_q!`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.q_fact_3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.q_fact_3","kind":"def","line":139,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/WedderburnMassFormula.lean#L139-L141","doc":"The `q`-factorial `[3]_q! = [3]_q · [2]_q · [1]_q\n= (1 + q + q²)(1 + q)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.q_int_3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.q_int_3","kind":"def","line":136,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/WedderburnMassFormula.lean#L136-L137","doc":"The `q`-integer `[3]_q = 1 + q + q²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.q_int_2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.q_int_2","kind":"def","line":133,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/WedderburnMassFormula.lean#L133-L134","doc":"The `q`-integer `[2]_q = 1 + q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.hasHoefsmitData_vacuum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.hasHoefsmitData_vacuum","kind":"instance","line":117,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/WedderburnMassFormula.lean#L117-L129","doc":"**Vacuum Hoefsmit data**: at `(Z, N) = (0, 0)` (no nucleons,\nno Hecke generators), the seminormal data collapses to the\ntrivial identity:\n- `numGenerators = 0` (empty set)\n- `V_std = 0` (no generators contribute)\n- `lambda_sym = lambda_alt = 1` (empty product)\nThe bindingTerm is then `α · Σ_{i ∈ ∅} … = 0`, so vacuum has\nzero binding contribution. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.lambda_alt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.lambda_alt","kind":"def","line":114,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/WedderburnMassFormula.lean#L114-L115","doc":"Alternating eigenvalue product (accessor). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.lambda_sym","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.lambda_sym","kind":"def","line":111,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/WedderburnMassFormula.lean#L111-L112","doc":"Symmetric eigenvalue product (accessor). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.V_std","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.V_std","kind":"def","line":108,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/WedderburnMassFormula.lean#L108-L109","doc":"Standard-rep traced volume (accessor). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.numGenerators","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.numGenerators","kind":"def","line":105,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/WedderburnMassFormula.lean#L105-L106","doc":"Number of NF generators (accessor). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.HasHoefsmitData.lambda_alt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.HasHoefsmitData.lambda_alt","kind":"def","line":103,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/WedderburnMassFormula.lean#L103-L103","doc":"Alternating eigenvalue product `λᵢ^alt = ∏ⱼ (-cⱼ q⁻¹ + dⱼ)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.HasHoefsmitData.lambda_sym","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.HasHoefsmitData.lambda_sym","kind":"def","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/WedderburnMassFormula.lean#L101-L101","doc":"Symmetric eigenvalue product `λᵢ^sym = ∏ⱼ (cⱼ q + dⱼ)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.HasHoefsmitData.V_std","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.HasHoefsmitData.V_std","kind":"def","line":99,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/WedderburnMassFormula.lean#L99-L99","doc":"Standard-rep traced volume `V̂ᵢ^std = z·aᵢ + bᵢ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.HasHoefsmitData.numGenerators","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.HasHoefsmitData.numGenerators","kind":"def","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/WedderburnMassFormula.lean#L97-L97","doc":"Number of NF generators contributing to the binding term. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.HasHoefsmitData.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.HasHoefsmitData.mk","kind":"ctor","line":95,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/WedderburnMassFormula.lean#L95-L95","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.HasHoefsmitData","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.HasHoefsmitData","kind":"class","line":94,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/WedderburnMassFormula.lean#L94-L103","doc":"**Hoefsmit seminormal data — class-supplied per `(Z, N)`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.alpha_bind","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.alpha_bind","kind":"def","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/WedderburnMassFormula.lean#L82-L83","doc":"Binding scale `α = m_e · 8 G`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.catalan_G","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.catalan_G","kind":"def","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/WedderburnMassFormula.lean#L70-L80","doc":"Catalan's constant `G ≈ 0.91596559417721901505460351493238411077414937428167`\n(mpmath `mp.dps = 50`).\nDefined as the rational approximation; the irrationality of\nCatalan's constant is open (Apéry-style result not yet\navailable in Mathlib), so we use the standard high-precision\ndecimal. Bumped from 22-dps to 50-dps literal 2026-06-07\n(paired with the symbolic `QOU.Archimedean.catalan_G` /\n`vol_B3 := 8 · catalan_G` refactor — see\n`QOU.Archimedean.HyperbolicVolumeTranscendence` §0). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.m_e","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.m_e","kind":"def","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/WedderburnMassFormula.lean#L66-L68","doc":"Electron rest mass (CODATA 2022, MeV/c²). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.m_n","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.m_n","kind":"def","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/WedderburnMassFormula.lean#L62-L64","doc":"Neutron rest mass (CODATA 2022, MeV/c²). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.m_p","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.m_p","kind":"def","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/WedderburnMassFormula.lean#L58-L60","doc":"Proton rest mass (CODATA 2022, MeV/c²). ","signatureChunk":0}]}